WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:02.166
- Thanks for the drive, Zeke.

00:00:02.166 --> 00:00:04.666
- OK, Dak, enter the casino. You just need to win one—

00:00:04.666 --> 00:00:06.791
- OK, tell Dak he just needs to win—

00:00:06.791 --> 00:00:09.041
- OK, tell Kellen Moore to tell Dak to win.

00:00:12.875 --> 00:00:14.000
- [Announcer:] Interception!

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.041
- [Jerry Jones:] Careful, you're surrounded by serious threats.

00:00:17.041 --> 00:00:19.500
- So, uh, my dude. What are the rules?

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.250
- Oh, I thought you had done this before.

00:00:21.250 --> 00:00:21.916
- I call.

00:00:22.666 --> 00:00:23.750
- I ain't call back, though.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:25.625
- Wait, I have to play Tom Brady?

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:27.541
The Bills get to play against Skylar Thompson.

00:00:27.541 --> 00:00:29.041
- Go fish!

00:00:29.041 --> 00:00:31.375
- No, no, no. Go Bills.

00:00:31.375 --> 00:00:33.000
- [Dak:] And I don't even know who is left for Baltimore.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.166
- You're Ray Lewis with a fake moustache.

00:00:35.166 --> 00:00:36.750
- Man, I said I'm No-Name Johnson.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:38.375
And I lettered at Minnesota Southern.

00:00:38.375 --> 00:00:41.166
- OK, daddy needs to recoup massive crypto losses.

00:00:41.166 --> 00:00:43.750
- Looks like Brady's tell is that every time he's inconvenienced,

00:00:43.750 --> 00:00:45.541
he destroys a tablet.

00:00:45.541 --> 00:00:47.791
- Stupid thing givin' me bad cards!

00:00:47.791 --> 00:00:48.791
[Banging and shattering]

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:49.500
- Call.

00:00:49.500 --> 00:00:52.375
- Ah, once again, bested by my enemy...

00:00:52.375 --> 00:00:53.125
DVOA.

00:00:53.125 --> 00:00:54.166
- How'd I do?

00:00:54.166 --> 00:00:56.500
- Wait, wait.
- [Together:] Is this kid, like, really good?

00:00:56.500 --> 00:00:57.500
- Hey, man...

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:59.125
- [Together:] I love your hair. Jinx!

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:00.875
- There, there. You're coming with me.

00:01:00.875 --> 00:01:02.500
- OK, let's see your cards.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.250
- We won.

00:01:03.250 --> 00:01:06.000
- Please give me some privacy as I publicly mull retirement.

00:01:09.041 --> 00:01:12.083
- Shaken not stirred, what the f**k is that?

00:01:12.083 --> 00:01:13.958
All we have is warm Yuengling and water.

00:01:13.958 --> 00:01:16.416
- Um, I can make you a burger if I can find you a grill.

00:01:16.416 --> 00:01:17.541
Oh, they left.

00:01:18.958 --> 00:01:20.458
- You know, I used to coach the Eagles.

00:01:20.458 --> 00:01:22.416
- Very cool.

